# S63: the bookend, S01's corridor again: Classic at 320x200 shown 4:3, id's 72 Hz ticks,
# no status bar, S01's Brightness 0.7. A linear dolly carried through the handles. No
# sound: the corridor is silent in id's mixer.
#
# Under V3-54: "And underneath, pixel for pixel, it is still nineteen ninety-six."

map e1m1

duration 7.2
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7

camera path
key 0    480,-363.92,110  0,90  ease linear
key 7.2  480,-278.08,110  0,90

sound off
events on
